ighly responsible and problem\u2011solving, yet his moody, loner, and weak\u2011leadership characteristics suggest poor crew cooperation.\n**Remaining uncertainty:** I lack concrete evidence of A\u2019s ability to work effectively with a crew, and I have no positive teamwork/communication data for D. I also do not know how severe C\u2019s communication difficulty is in practice.\n**What would change my vote:** Direct evidence that A consistently demonstrates strong teamwork and communication, or that D possesses proven crew\u2011interaction strengths, would shift my preference toward them. Conversely, evidence that C\u2019s communication issues have led to safety\u2011critical incidents would move me away from C.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
